  "description": "Verify that a customer can change the currency on the Home page, add one or more products from the Home page through the Product Details Page (PDP), apply an eligible coupon on the Cart page, and see the applied coupon details and discount amount in the selected currency on both Cart and Order Confirmation page.",
  "priority": "critical",
